{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"a1b91ea2-c019-4381-bf21-a3741b067c35","status":"ERROR","response":"# Bhojpur vs. Wardha: Monsoon Crop Yield Change (2023 vs. 2024)\n\n\u003e **Source:** [`field register`](file:///workspace/field_harvest.csv)\n\nHere is the comparative analysis and yield change (in **tonnes per hectare**) exclusively for **Bhojpur** and **Wardha** blocks across the 2023 and 2024 Monsoon seasons.\n\n---\n\n### Yield Comparison \u0026 Change Table\n\n| Block | Season | 2023 Yield (t/ha) | 2024 Yield (t/ha) | Absolute Change ($\\Delta$) | Growth (%) | 2023 Area \u0026 Harvest | 2024 Area \u0026 Harvest | Source |\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| **Wardha** | Monsoon | **2.50 t/ha** | **2.70 t/ha** | 🟢 **+0.20 t/ha** | 🟢 **+8.00%** | 390 ha / 975 t | 400 ha / 1,080 t | `field register` |\n| **Bhojpur** | Monsoon | **2.40 t/ha** | **2.50 t/ha** | 🟢 **+0.10 t/ha** | 🟢 **+4.17%** | 580 ha / 1,392 t | 600 ha / 1,500 t | `field register` |\n| **Combined** | **Monsoon** | **2.44 t/ha** | **2.58 t/ha** | 🟢 **+0.14 t/ha** | 🟢 **+5.74%** | **970 ha / 2,367 t** | **1,000 ha / 2,580 t** | `field register` |\n\n---\n\n### Visual Comparison (t/ha)\n\n```\nWardha  : 2023 [2.50 t/ha] ───────────────► 2024 [2.70 t/ha]  (+0.20 t/ha | +8.00% 📈)\nBhojpur : 2023 [2.40 t/ha] ────────► 2024 [2.50 t/ha]        (+0.10 t/ha | +4.17% 📈)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Comparison Takeaways\n\n1. **Wardha** achieved double the absolute yield gain of Bhojpur (**+0.20 t/ha** vs. **+0.10 t/ha**) and had the higher rate of growth (**+8.00%** vs. **+4.17%**).\n2. In 2024, **Wardha** maintained higher land efficiency (**2.70 t/ha**), whereas **Bhojpur** matched Wardha's 2023 yield baseline (**2.50 t/ha**).\n3. **Bhojpur** remains the larger contributor in total volume (1,500 tonnes produced over 600 hectares in 2024).\n\n---\n\n### Download the Table\n\n- **Direct CSV Download:** [`/workspace/bhojpur_wardha_yield_comparison_2023_2024.csv`](file:///workspace/bhojpur_wardha_yield_comparison_2023_2024.csv)\n- **Raw Master Register:** [`/workspace/field_harvest.csv`](file:///workspace/field_harvest.csv)\n","error":"declaring permissions: cortex tool write_to_file: convert tool call for permissions: model output error: invalid tool call error (invalid_args) /workspace/index.html is not a valid artifact path; artifacts must be in /home/benchmark/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/a1b91ea2-c019-4381-bf21-a3741b067c35/","duration_seconds":136.057622331,"num_turns":3,"usage":{"input_tokens":169271,"output_tokens":33760,"thinking_tokens":5237,"cache_read_tokens":359116,"total_tokens":203031}}}
